sequenceDiagram
    title Governed CIGAR agent handoff
    participant ParentAgent
    participant ParentSpace
    participant Policy
    participant ChildSpace
    participant ChildAgent

    ParentAgent->>ParentSpace: Propose delegated task
    ParentSpace->>Policy: Evaluate requested scope
    Policy-->>ParentSpace: Attenuated grants
    ParentSpace->>ChildSpace: Signed handoff capsule
    ChildSpace->>Policy: Reauthorize references
    Policy-->>ChildSpace: Accepted scope
    ChildSpace->>ChildAgent: Recipient context bundle
    ChildAgent->>ChildSpace: Typed result delta
    ChildSpace-->>ParentSpace: Signed result material
    ParentSpace->>Policy: Reauthorize returned data
    Policy-->>ParentSpace: Merge authority
    ParentSpace-->>ParentAgent: Commit or conflict
